t party · 4 companions · All affinities</span></div>`],menu:['PAUSE MENU','Take a breath, Wayfarer','The frontier will wait for you.',`<div class="modal-grid"><div class="modal-tile"><b>☷ Quest journal</b><span>Review your current objectives</span></div><div class="modal-tile"><b>⌖ Region atlas</b><span>Explore your discovered map</span></div></div>`]};
